window.products.push({"id":1136083,"name":"Bagus Moisture absorber Hanging Bags (8 Pack) - 10.5 Oz, Fragrance-Free Dehumidifier Bags, Moisture Absorber for Closet, Bathroom, Storage, Kitchens, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fs05fYYnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【EFFECTIVE ABSORBING】 –Hanging bag for moisture use Spherical calcium chloride to enlarge the area to absorb quickly. One-way moisture permeable paper absorbs effectively. 450 ml/pack large capacity moisture absorption keep dry for a long time.Protects clothes and items from excess moisture damage and trap excess moisture from the air, providing long-lasting protection against humidity. ✔️【Visible Effec】 – Ranslucent design for the water storage bag, so that you can see the water added day by day. You’ll see the results in its clear plastic bag! We aim to create a dry and comfortable indoor environment for you. ✔️【DEHUMIDIFICATION PROCESS】 – When you start to use the moisture absorber bucket, soon the white calcium chloride begins to dissolve and gather into a whole piece, and small water droplets appear in the water accumulation area. As the dehumidification goes on, the white particles will eventually dissolve & disappear, a large amount of water will appear in the stagnant area. Lasts up to 60 days (Duration will vary depending on temperature and humidity) ✔️【HOW THEY WORK】 – The white beads swell and become solid mass as they absorb moisture; Once they become completely solidified, they will start to release liquid in the lower part; They may take time, but it does not mean they are not working. [LIFE TIME WARRANTY] Our products are supported with new replacement or full refund with no time limits if they don’t work. ✔️【SPECIAL DESIGN】 – Use One-way moisture permeable paper, We won't have to worry about water will leak dirty clothes. Ideal for us in porch, shoe ark, chest, bedroom, kitchen, sitting room,bathrooms, closets, laundry rooms , basements and so on.Physical dehumidification gives you a Safe, Green & Energy-saving life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fs05fYYnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bagus","source_asin":"B092ZNDQ4S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092ZNDQ4S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092ZNDQ4S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
