window.products.push({"id":1136144,"name":"Talking Kitchen Scale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tA9f4EJL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"This invaluable kitchen tool is both attractive and practical. Simply place something on the raised glass platform; and count to three. Its weight will be immediately determined; shown on the large display; and spoken in a clear; female voice. Now; when the recipe calls for an 8-ounce can of condensed milk; or a 1-pound bag of chocolate chips; you'll know right away what size to add to the batter. You can find out how much the head of lettuce weighs before you add it to your salad; keep plates for dinner guests all the same size; determine how much milk is left in the jug; and even figure out how much serial you can eat to stay within the requirements of your diet. Your new Kitchen Scale boasts four High-precision strain gauge sensors; so the weight it gives you is accurate to the nearest gram (0.035 ounces). To turn on; simply press the button; then place your first item. The scale will stay on for several minutes; and announce any changes in weight it detects; so if you're still measuring or have something else to weigh; there's no need to press the button again. The scale will announce the weight of the new measurement or item automatically. After a while; it will shut off by itself to save battery power. The platform is made of toughened glass; and measures 8 by 6-1/2 inches (205 by 165 MM). The display is three quarters of an inch high - great for low-vision folks. The scale can weigh up to 12 pounds (5 kilograms); and can report weight in pounds; ounces; grams; or milliliters. Takes 2 AAA batteries; which are not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-tA9f4EJL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Braille Superstore","source_asin":"B0093QR23A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0093QR23A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0093QR23A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
