window.products.push({"id":1136207,"name":"Luxton Home 2 Drawer Storage Organizer – 60 Second Fast Assembly, No Tools Needed, Small Gray Linen Tower Dresser Chest Dorm Room Essential, Closet, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TZlq7o1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNLIKE OTHER STORAGE UNITS with drawers that take up to 30 MINUTES TO ASSEMBLE the Luxton Home storage organizer TAKES 60 SECONDS OR LESS! Easy to put together with no screws or tools needed (assembly instructions included), the closet drawers for clothes offers the fastest flash assembly yet! Unique patented foldable design is easy to disassemble, and features supportive arms under each drawer to ensure they slide smoothly in and out. Sturdy steel metal outer frame supports the closet organizer with drawers, and non-slip feet protect your floor from scratches. This stylish three drawer storage goes well with light airy decor, perfect for your closet, entryway, office, bedroom, nursery, bathroom, playroom, laundry room or craft room. An affordable 2 drawer cart for college dormitories or organizing storage space in your campus closet, with concealed storage that’s convenient and easy to access. Soft and thick, lightweight breathable textured fabric drawers with easy-pull front handle are available in 2 colors and look great as a linen tower for bathrooms. Easily separate your winter and summer clothes, lingerie, gloves, hats and scarfs, or store fresh linen, sweaters, jeans and even blankets with our functional bedroom organizer. This compact storage chest fits into small spaces so you can walk into your closet, clutter-free! The Luxton Home small dressers with drawers are surprisingly deep - great for storing papers, light office supplies, hair products, makeup and even hold a printer. Hard-wearing and durable, the fabricated MDF laminate wood top can be used as a bedside stand, while the beautifully neutral taupe drawers add a great touch to your bedside decor. And, you can even use the clothes cabinets for bedroom in your RV when you have travel guests...the possibilities are endless. Revolutionizing Storage Space, The Luxton Home 2 Drawer Storage Organizer Is A Must-have Addition For Any Home or Dorm Space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TZlq7o1CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luxton Home","source_asin":"B07MRZTVHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MRZTVHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MRZTVHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
