window.products.push({"id":1136217,"name":"Little Critterz Chipmunk Chipper - Home Decor Birthday Gift Miniature Porcelain Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fTw5-In9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Little Critterz Â are adorable, collectible carded miniature porcelain figurines, about 1.75 \" high or long depending on the shape of each of each animal. Each is hand crafted and hand painted by skilled artisans to represent the unique color and detail of each of each animal. A perfect gift for your friends, family or yourself and a delightful addition to any collection. Packaged in a clear 2 \"x 2 \" recyclable plastic collector box. Critter Tailz Fun Fact: Chipmunks with their distinctive striped coats are found only in North America except for the Siberian chipmunk of Asia. Cheek pouches let them carry food items to burrows for storage. CAUTION! NOT A TOY. Decorative Item Only. WARNING! CHOKING HAZARD. Not for children under 3 years. Not intended for consumption or for use in stove, microwave or dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fTw5-In9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Little Critterz","source_asin":"B00689E9FY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00689E9FY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00689E9FY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
