window.products.push({"id":1136307,"name":"Anolon Titanium Stainless Steel Pasta Insert with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413WTCZDAAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Spaghetti, ravioli and even corn on the cob cook perfectly in this versatile insert. Just lifi the pasta insert out, and let the water drain effortlessly back into the pot. The 18/10 stainless steel construction lets you put it in the dishwasher for easy cleaning and long-lasting beauty. Designed to fit conveniently into 8 and 10 qt. pots. ... Amazon.com Straining cooked pasta the old fashioned way can mean battling a heavy pot and a cloud of steam. This lidded pasta insert from Anolon provides a convenient alternative-it lets you cook and strain in the same unit. Strong and beautiful, the piece is constructed of 18/10 stainless steel in a stair-step design, so it's compatible with 8-quart or 10-quart pots. The lid fits snugly, while the insert's raised feet ensure thorough water circulation during cooking. Anolon's riveted HollowCore handles stay cool on the stovetop, with comfortable clearance and a textured surface. Small enough even for angel hair pasta, the insert's holes are also great for straining corn on the cob and potatoes. When you're all through cooking, just pop it in the dishwasher, and the satiny finish comes out like new. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/413WTCZDAAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anolon","source_asin":"B00005OWDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005OWDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005OWDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1136308,"name":"Yamazaki Seasons 20 Piece Set, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3170TJ9QE5L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Four -5 Piece Placesettings-gift boxed. Amazon.com Sculpted into a sensuous, contemporary look, Seasons flatware from Yamazaki suits casual or formal dining. Each brightly polished piece rounds in the middle, tapers, then flares into an upturned, beveled, flat end. Made of heavy-gauge, hot-forged 18/8 stainless steel, this 20-piece set includes 4 of each of the following: 9-1/4-inch dinner knife, 8-1/4-inch dinner fork, 7-inch salad fork, 7-1/2-inch soup spoon, and 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. Seasons flatware feels absolutely smooth and solid feeling, with an ideal heft and balance. The hollow-handled knife features a blade made of high-carbon cutlery steel that maintains its finely-honed edge even after repeated use. While Yamazaki stainless-steel flatware is dishwasher-safe, the company recommends removing the flatware after the wash cycle and drying by hand to prevent spotting. Another good tip is to avoid dishwashing compounds that contain lemon. Yamazaki covers the flatware with a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3170TJ9QE5L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yamazaki","source_asin":"B0000CFGK3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136308","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFGK3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFGK3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
