window.products.push({"id":1136320,"name":"CANMOV Power Lift Recliner Chair for Elderly Massage Recliner Chair with Heat & Vibration Heavy Duty and Safety Motion Reclining Mechanism - Antiskid ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mATdF11OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"➤【Power Lift Recliner Chair】Silent Lift Motor can pushes the entire chair up to help the elderly stand up easily without adding stress to back or knees. It features reclining to different angles by electric control, you can lie down in a comfortable position and take a rest, and the footrest can be extended and retracted that allows you to stretch your body. ➤【Massage & Heating Function】10 different modes meet your demand of different massage. The 4 areas of massage focus shin, thigh, lumbar, shoulder. You can freely choose the intensity and location of massage. Lumbar heating function with massage to make your waist more comfortable. Massage, heating and lift functions can controlled by a single multi-function remote for your easy use. There is timer function in 5/10/15/20/25 minutes which is convenient for you to set massaging time. ➤【Heavy Duty and Convenient Design】Wide design for ultimate comfort and padded seat and arm rests. Weight Capacity - 300 lbs, Measure - 33\"W x 30\"D x 41\"H, Seat Height - 19.6\", Seat Dimensions - 20\"W x 20\"D. Kindly please confirm the size before buying. Pocket on the right side of the lift chair keeps remotes and other small items, you can watching TV, read newspaper on the power lift chair. ➤【High Quality Material】Luxurious power lift recliner with high-density foam and laminated veneer lumber (LVL) system to provide maximum comfort and stability, suitable for living room, bedroom and home theater room. Tip: The recliner comes with 2 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver them to your door on different days. ➤【Buy with Confidence】It takes only several steps to assemble the chair, with an instruction manual inside and no extra tools are needed. CANMOV provide free exchange for damaged and missing parts with 1-year warranty guarantee, feel free to contact us for any purchase. CANMOV provide helpful, prompt and friendly customer service at your disposal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mATdF11OS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANMOV","source_asin":"B084G7K3SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084G7K3SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084G7K3SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
