window.products.push({"id":1136339,"name":"Out of the Woods of Oregon Deluxe Red Alder Knife Board and Bread Slicer Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iRAoPy2RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Live green- be green. Out of the woods of Oregon is proud of our green heritage. Long before it was fashionable, we were concerned with conserving our resources and caring for our environment. Our wood products are made in Eugene, Oregon using Oregon red alder. Red alder is a sustainable hardwood that flourishes in the lush climate of the coastal pacific northwest. Red alder is re-planted as it is harvested ensuring the sustainability of this beautiful resource for decades to come. Of equal importance to us, is the wise use of the wood. Much of our wood comes from local furniture manufacturers because we are able to use their short and narrow pieces (fall down) to create many of our products. Short boards, not long enough for their use, are used to make our cutting and serving boards. Very narrow pieces of wood are used to make our spice racks and push pulls. We even use our saw dust to heat many of our buildings. We offer an extensive line of cutting boards for basic kitchen use as well as a wide assortment of specialty boards great for serving dips, pate's, cheeses, and oils. We are proud to be wood workers in Eugene, Oregon and we hope you will enjoy using our products as much as we enjoy making them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iRAoPy2RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Out of the Woods of Oregon","source_asin":"B001DSR7NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001DSR7NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001DSR7NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1136340,"name":"Home-X Transparent Bread Box, Clear Plastic Container for Standard Loaf – 12” L x 5.5” W x 4.75” H, BPA Free","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FDopPGcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Organize the Kitchen: Upgrade your counter storage with this plastic bread holder! Its rectangular size is perfect for a bread loaf sliced or un-sliced, so you'll keep your bread fresh longer. This convenient bread container will also keep your bread protected on a kitchen counter, pantry shelf, in the refrigerator, or in the freezer. No longer will your counter look messy, with your bread just sitting in the bag. Organize your pantry and cabinet with food storage containers designed for maximum freshness. Take Bread to Go: The Home-X Bread Box is great for picnics, glamping, and other adventures when you need to store and protect food on the go. Take it camping to store your sandwich rolls, hotdog buns, and hamburger buns. Use it during your next picnic to cover your treats from bugs or at the tailgate to keep your food fresh for curbside enjoyment! Plus, when you come back home, this container will be easy to clean: it is dishwasher safe (top rack only), so cleanup is a breeze. Good for the Earth and Good for Your Health: With a reusable bread keeper, you'll reduce your plastic bag consumption and exposure to grocery store germs. Use it to transport baked goods home from the local bakery or as a container to deliver a home-baked bread loaf to a neighbor or friend. When you use the HOME-X Bread Box, you can rest assured that you're using safe, BPA-free plastic for all your bread storing needs. Reduce your negative impact on the planet and keep your food fresh at the same time. It's a win-win.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FDopPGcvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B08B5FGPG1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B5FGPG1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B5FGPG1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
