window.products.push({"id":1136409,"name":"ZNSAYOTX 4 Piece Jacquard Couch Covers for 3 Cushion Couch Super Stretch Thick Soft Sofa Cover Anti Slip Elastic Sofa Slipcover for Dogs Pets Furnitur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaQXYICEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 SEPARATED DESIGN - ZNSAYOTX 4 piece sofa slipcovers are specially designed for 3 cushion couch, the package includes one base sofa cover, three cushion covers. Highly recommended for sofa with separated cushion. Due to the separating designs, the magic sofa slipcover can decor your sofa without changing the sofa. Elastic bands sewn on the bottom of both cushion cover and base slipcover, which can make the couch covers more suitable and anti slip High Stretch - ZNSAYOTX high elastic jacquard couch covers are crafted by 85% polyester and 15% spandex material. The premium fabric makes the stretch sofa covers soft, comfortable, skin friendly, wrinkle-free and durable. The heavy duty couch slipcovers with jacquard checkers fit for most types sofa: t-cushion sofas, box-cushion sofas, leather sofas, fabric sofa and extra large sofas, etc. And the miracle couch protector slipcovers are not easily pilling and fading, can be used for years 360-degree Full Protection - The fitted couch cover provide an universal coverage for your sofa furniture, even the back part and the bottom part of you sofa. The decorative sofa furniture protector can protect your sofa from daily stains, pet footprint, dog hair, cats scratch and some accidental tears. Besides, our couch slipcover can transform your old couch to a new delicate centerpiece. A effortless way to protect and decor your sofa while keeping the appearance Effortless Installation & Care - Installation is an easy case. Following the SOFA SLIPCOVER INSTALLASTION GUIDANCE, you can complete installment by one person within 10 minutes. The universal couch slipcovers are available for wash, also can machine wash. Separately wash at cold water and gentle cycle with mild detergent for good care and maintenance, tumble dry low or line dry. Besides, bleach and iron are not suitable for this stretchy couch slipcover Size Choose and Tips - 2 Piece Chair Cover: 31\"-46\", 3 Piece Loveseat Slipcover: 55\"-69\", 4 Piece Sofa Cover: 71\"-91\", 4 Piece XL Couch Cover: 91\"-110\". Please measure your sofa size before purchasing according to the MEASURING GUIDE. If your sofa size between two sizes, please choose the larger one. We firmly believe our stretchable elastic sofa cover will perfectly fit your sofa, but if you have any concerns or questions, we will be pleased to support you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LaQXYICEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZNSAYOTX","source_asin":"B08F1Z6RGY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F1Z6RGY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F1Z6RGY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
