window.products.push({"id":1136579,"name":"Midea 8,000 BTU U-Shaped Smart Inverter Window Air Conditioner–Cools up to 350 Sq. Ft., Ultra Quiet with Open Window Flexibility, Works with Alexa/Goo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L5rWITcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: Introducing the first-ever U-shaped Inverter Window Air Conditioner that allows you to open or close your window while the unit is installed. The innovative design makes installation very easy, and the ability to close the window isolates the noise outside making it ultra-quiet. Ultra Quiet - The U-shaped design blocks the noise coming from the compressor outside. Quick & Easy Installation - Includes a quick-snap bracket. Long-distance Airflow up to 20 feet - The strong airflow allows you to feel the cold air up to 20 feet away. *Please note: Depending on the climate in your area, as well as room size, you may need to purchase a larger unit for best effect. WARRANTY: 1 Year Parts & Labor Warranty comes with each Midea product to ensure the quality of our brand to our customers. Our team is happy to help if any questions or issues arise and make sure to register your product on our website for even faster support in the future. FAQs: 1. Whether the product comes with a mounting bracket and mounting accessories? - Yes, no separated purchase needed. 2.This is my first installation experience, how can I install the item? (1) can read the instruction of installation manual or watch the installation video < Midea U-Shaped AC installation > on the detail page >. 3.There is a gap between the body and the installation accessories after installation. - Please see the installation video on the product page for the steps to seal the gap. 4.I found that there are missing parts in the package. - Please check the packages carefully and there are some brackets that may be in the corner or under the foam (ex. L brackets). 5.Can the screen be adjusted when the window is opened? - The screen is adjustable between 23”-36” for when people open their window – The height would be fixed at height from bottom of U to top of the unit. *Reference adjustable screen separately sold. 6.The machine is not cooling or cooling slowly. (1) Please select the appropriate capacity section according to the recommended area. (2) Check if the machine is in cooling mode. 8. The air volume is not enough to feel the wind. - Midea U Smart Inverter uses a silent air duct design, and the air supply distance reaches 20 feet. While increasing the air volume, the wind noise is much smaller than the ordinary window machine. 9. Can the display light of the machine and the key “beep” sound be turned off? -This is a regular feature and cannot be turned off at this time. A new version of the APP is being developed, and the function of turning off the display light and key tone will be realized by then. 10. What mobile phone permissions are required for the APP? -GPS and camera permissions. Includes a quick-snap bracket.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L5rWITcOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Midea","source_asin":"B0C749KCTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C749KCTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C749KCTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
