window.products.push({"id":1136704,"name":"iscream Sour Patch Kids Embossed 16.75\" x 12\" Candy Character Shaped Pillow, Orange","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XsyqiAg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's always room for one more cool, comfy, crazy throw pillow - especially when it's as fun as this tasty candy shaped classic! This full-color, embossed finish pillow looks like a giant Sour Patch Kids candy that's ready to liven up any space. And it isn't just fun to look at - this softy is filled with 100% polyester fiberfill so it's never lumpy or bumpy! Large pillow measures 16.75\" high x 12\" wide x 5.5\" deep. The perfect combination of colorful fun, to-die-for design, quintessential quality and cozy comfort - just what you expect from iscream! At iscream we are obsessed with fun, function and style - see our whole line for new ideas and old favorites with a new twist!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XsyqiAg9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iscream","source_asin":"B0BT298YPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BT298YPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BT298YPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1136705,"name":"FrancisFrancis! X3 Espresso Machine, Pallinato","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FZSHV43KL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Coffee house, shmoffee house. Brew at home in ultra-modern style with this FrancisFrancis! X3 espresso machine. The pallinatto finish takes stainless steel to a new level with shot-blasted micro-particles of porcelain, giving it a distinctive satiny look that won't chip, rust or stain. Compatible with both the Easy Serving Espresso system (pods) and regular ground coffee, the sleek X3 has a steam nozzle for cappuccinos and a hot-water dispenser for tea. It also features a brass boiler and 1-1/5L water reservoir. 1100 watts. Imported. 11-8/10Hx10-16/25Lx7-1/10W\". Amazon.com The friendly attitude of the FrancisFrancis! espresso machines is not just a cosmetic matter. Designed and assembled in Italy, the lines welcoming qualities extend to the brewing process too, so making espresso in your home is pleasurable, simple, and non-intimidating. One of the companys slimmest models, the FrancisFrancis! X3 machine is built to work with you whether youre an espresso novice or a skilled barista. Trim, sleek, and fun to look at, it features a brass boiler and a pump-driven brewing system with 8-9 bars of dynamic pressure. The chrome-plated brass brewing handle maintains ideal temperatures for coffee, while the steam/hot water wand swivels for tidy storage. Brewing can be done with your favorite loose grounds or the eminently simple ESE (Easy Serving Espresso) coffee pods, a pre-measured amount in a teabag-like container. The X3 comes with two brewing handles--one for loose grounds, one for pods--and three baskets to let you choose from ristretto, regular, or lungo shots. A tamper is also included. A good choice for small kitchens, the X3 measures 10-5/8 by 6-1/4 by 11-3/4 inches, so it has a smaller footprint than many models. The water tank is accessed from behind, and controls are on the side. The top of the machine has a handsome mirror finish, adding a pleasing gleam to accent the playfully bright body. Warranted for one year after purchase, the X3 comes with detailed and illustrated instructions for pulling the perfect shot. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FZSHV43KL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Francis!Francis!","source_asin":"B0000AFX4J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000AFX4J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000AFX4J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
