window.products.push({"id":1136735,"name":"ClipGrip Powerful Rechargeable Battery Operated Clip On Fan with Lifetime Guaranty & White Noise Option, Portable and Great for The Car, Desk, Strolle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G+NX3VKzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Life goes by fast. Enjoy it. Calm down. It's all funny. Next\" Everyone gets so upset about the wrong things.” Joan Rivers Remember those times when you just need air? The times when nothing is more important than just fresh air to calm you and those around you down? Sometimes there is nothing that can help refreshing out, not even your hat and hand fan. When you decide to purchase a regular boring fan and then discover you can’t take it with you anywhere you go, and find yourself in the same frustratedposition again and again. This is the exact moment we decided to create ClipGlip… This is what we call Eureka! We wanted to change the situation and we did it by creating the ClipGrip clip on fan. Take ClipGrip with you anywhere and clip it on almost any surface to get the right dosage of fresh windy air anytime. At ClipGrip, we know that a strong and powerful machine is a must to get the right effect. That is why we designed it with light, high quality ABS and a 4.5 Watt engine that runs with 2200 mAh rechargeable battery. It’s truly The Best Clip On Fan out there. So why ClipGrip? Lifetime Guaranty Lifetime Guaranty Strong & Light High Quality ABS Strong & Light High Quality ABS Turns Up to 360° Turns Up to 360° Clip It Anywhere Clip It Anywhere Includes a Case & eBook Gifts Includes a Case & eBook Gifts Use the ClipGrip clip on fan in your next car or on a stroller, in a camping trip, at the beach or by your desk as soon as possible. Click the “Add to cart\" button on the top right corner of the screen and the ClipGrip will be at your doorstep in no time. The air won't be your problem anymore. Thank God.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G+NX3VKzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ClipGrip","source_asin":"B01LAPHHT0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LAPHHT0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LAPHHT0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
