window.products.push({"id":1136859,"name":"Christmas Window Decorations Clings, Christmas Decorations Indoor Sticker Re-appliable Snowflake Santa Reindeer Christmas Wall Decor, Window Stickers ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3CjtrNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas Window Clings Set: Includes 4 large Christmas window stickers and 2 small Christmas Decor, a total of more than 200 Christmas window stickers. christmas decorations indoor contain many Christmas elements, such as snowmen, snowflakes, villages, sleighs, Santa Claus, moose and so on. The Christmas elements create a beautiful Christmas scene and add to the atmosphere. High Uality Material : The material of christmas window decorations is made of high quality electrostatic film PVC material, smooth and strong. Christmas window stickers are double-sided, with bright colors and clear printing, VENTTONG Christmas window stickers are a better choice as Christmas decorations. Super Easy to Use: Christmas window stickers are very easy to install, you just need to find a smooth surface, spray some water on it, peel the snowflake window sticker from the paper, stick the Christmas sticker on the smooth surface and then use a cardboard card to squeeze out the excess water. The window Christmas stickers will stick firmly to the smooth area. You can decorate your house with your children to add atmosphere to your holiday and increase your bond with them at the same time. Widely Used: Christmas decorations are suitable for Christmas parties, Christmas interior decoration. Window Christmas decorations can be used in homes, schools, offices, bars. It can be stuck on windows, glass, refrigerators, doors and other smooth places. You can even stick it on greeting cards, skateboards, mugs, gifts. These lovely stickers will bring you memories of a wonderful atmosphere. Hassle-Free Shopping: We are committed to providing the best products and services to our customers. If you have any questions about the quality and installation of our products, please feel free to contact us. We will give you a satisfactory answer within 24 hours to ensure your 100% satisfaction.Christmas Window Decals is best gift for friends.Adults and children can participate in Christmas decorations together, leaving unforgetable memories with your family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d3CjtrNfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VENTTONG","source_asin":"B0BKQWBGTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136859","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKQWBGTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKQWBGTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
