window.products.push({"id":1136925,"name":"Miiibooo Ceramic Dinner Plates Set of 4, Oval 10 Inch Large Porcelain Plates for Serving Steak, Pasta, Dessert, Bohemian Colorful Plate for Kitchen, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FCCtSueFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Eat Safty with Food Grade Material】Miiibooo dinner plates are made of high quality and eco-friendly clay through firing at high temperature, and adopted hand-painted craftsmanship. The ceramic plates are lead free and all natural glaze, cadmium free and non-toxic. Smooth glaze inside the dinner dish, non-fading, eat safe. That means you don't have to worry about any health issues. 【Dishwasher and Microwave Safe Plates】These kitchen plates are very easy to clean. You can wash them with dish soap and warm water or put them into your dishwasher, and can also be used in the refrigerator or disinfection cabinet. Also use these ceramic baking dishes in the microwave or oven. Miiibooo ceramic dinner plates are not only stylish, but also practical and durable, safe to use, making them a great investment for any household. 【Multi-purpose】 Oval porcelain plates, Length: 10 inch, Width: 7 inch, Height: 2 inch. Suitable for serving salad, steak, pasta, fruit, seafood, appetizer, pie, bread and other main course or dessert, also used as baking pans, baking dishes, perfect for daily use or party purposes. The exquisite colored plates can also be used as Christmas gifts, home gifts, Thanksgiving gifts, Father's gift, Housewarming gift for your friends or family. 【Well-Design】 An essential plate for any food in your kitchen, adopted unique binaural design, makes it easier to hold for you, and prevents the dish from falling. The elevated bottom has an anti-slip design, anti-scald texture design outside the plate surface, and is thick overall, which makes the colorful dinner plates with an effective heat insulation and anti-scalding effect. These dessert plates are easy to stack without taking up much space. Make your food neatly that looks even more delicious. 【Beautiful Boho Style】Our plate set of 4 are full color with a rich and harmonious tone. Each plate own unique pattern, can satisfy everyone's favorite in the family. You can mix and match the plates to create a fun and eclectic table setting, also use them all together for a more coordinated look. Our breakfast ceramic plates can also bring a good visual experience while you are tasting delicious. Vibrant colors and intricate bohemia patterns make the food look more delicious and make you enjoyable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FCCtSueFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Miiibooo","source_asin":"B0BD798MMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD798MMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD798MMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
