window.products.push({"id":1136952,"name":"Elegear Rainbow Throw Girls Blanket, Unique Tie-dye Flannel Blanket Super Soft Cute Decorative Floor Sofa Couch Throw Warm Cozy Fuzzy Blanket for Adul","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BUfXxNymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy The Ultra Warm Cozy Touch - Colorful Throw Blanket is made of super comfortable flannel material, with Japanese Heatwarm +2℃ Technology. To give you and your family warm and comfort while you sit on the sofa watching TV or your children spread it out on the floor to play. Your kids will sleep peacefully in the soft plush comfort. Colorful Blanket Like No Other - Funny blanket - The rainbow throw blanket adopts tie-dyeing technology, and each blanket is handmade, so that the color and pattern of each blanket are different. And the tie dye blanket uses environmentally friendly dyes, absolutely skin-friendly, unique, and matched with rainbow tones, making your family dinner full of fun and dreamy atmosphere. Your child deserves a piece of art as unique as them. Premium Quality & Safety - The blanket has passed the OEKO-TEX certification, so your children can also use it safely. The fabric is added with moisture-absorbing and heating yarn, which can quickly heat up 2~5℃. The 260GSM flannel blanket will not pile up over time, will not shed hair, will not fade. At the same time, the fleece blanket is anti-static, keeping you away from annoying static electricity in winter. Perfect For Gifting - Every girl needs a beautiful and colorful pink throw blanket, whether at home, school, traveling or camping. This is not just a blanket. It will accompany them to grow up together, spend all their significant moments, and become their treasured keepsake in the future. Elegear rainbow cute blanket is the perfect gift for your family & friends for Birthdays, Children's Day, Mother's Day, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas. Machine Washable - Just throw it into the machine to clean, which is very easy to care for. Our blankets are tightly stitched and are resistant to shrinkage, so they can maintain their shape after each wash. Avoid direct heating, do not bleach. This cute soft blankets is lightweight and warm, and can be used in all seasons. It can be used as sofa blanket, travel blanket, camping blanket and bed blanket. Let it be your fashion item, don’t miss it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BUfXxNymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegear","source_asin":"B0BNWRPK8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1136952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNWRPK8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNWRPK8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
